"style":"font-size: 10px; color: var(--allo-stem-text-soft, #94a3b8); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;"},"Max stress"],["DIV",{"style":"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800; color: rgb(245, 158, 11); margin-top: 2px;"},"10 MPa"],["DIV",{"style":"font-size: 10px; color: var(--allo-stem-text-soft, #94a3b8); margin-top: 3px; line-height: 1.45;"},"Force squeezed into each bit of material. Must stay well BELOW the yield number beside it."]],["DIV",{"style":"padding: 8px; border-radius: 6px; background: var(--allo-stem-canvas, #0f172a); border: 1px solid var(--allo-stem-border, #334155);"},["DIV",{"style":"font-size: 10px; color: var(--allo-stem-text-soft, #94a3b8); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;"},"Material yield"],["DIV",{"style":"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800; color: rgb(148, 163, 184); margin-top: 2px;"},"350 MPa"],["DIV",{"style":"font-size: 10px; color: var(--allo-stem-text-soft, #94a3b8); margin-top: 3px; line-height: 1.45;"},"The stress where this material starts to permanently bend or tear. Your ceiling."]],["DIV",{"style":"padding: 8px; border-radius: 6px; background: var(--allo-stem-canvas, #0f172a); border: 1px solid var(--allo-stem-border, #334155);"},["DIV",{"style":"font-size: 10px; color: var(--allo-stem-text-soft, #94a3b8); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;"},"Buckling load (P_cr)"],["DIV",{"style":"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800; color: rgb(167, 139, 250); margin-top: 2px;"},"716 kN"],["DIV",{"style":"font-size: 10px; color: var(--allo-stem-text-soft, #94a3b8); margin-top: 3px; line-height: 1.45;"},"The push at which the weakest strut snaps sideways, like a spaghetti noodle pressed from both ends."]],["DIV",{"style":"padding: 8px; border-radius: 6px; background: var(--allo-stem-canvas, #0f172a); border: 1px solid var(--allo-stem-border, #334155);"},["DIV",{"style":"font-size: 10px; color: var(--allo-stem-text-soft, #94a3b8); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;"},"Weakest strut"],["DIV"